{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/Demo_Information.png?t=1745244503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When playing Skatehouse, keep in mind that it\u2019s <strong>a small-scale skate shop simulator.</strong> There are no endless queues or checkout lines\u2014just the fun of building your own little skate shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and manage your own shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your supply chain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fulfill custom orders and sell skateboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your store and unlock new items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUT:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No customers walking around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No complicated business mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/Skatehoue_Header.gif?t=1745244503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/SteamGIF1.gif?t=1745244503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/Manage_Your_Skate_Shop.png?t=1745244503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and customize your dream skate shop, choose what products to display, and manage individual skate parts. Upgrade your supply chain to produce more and keep your shelves stocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/SteamGIF2.gif?t=1745244503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/Sell_Your_Boards.png?t=1745244503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine different parts and sell complete boards. Unlock new boards to meet skaters' demands and grow your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/SteamGIF3.gif?t=1745244503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/Expand_Your_Store.png?t=1745244503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your store by unlocking more rooms to introduce new sections for apparel, accessories, and even different types of boards.\u00a0Build a reputable skate shop that stands out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/Featured_Brands.png?t=1745244503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/extras/Featured_Brands_Banner.png?t=1745244503\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3153020?t=1745244503","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3153020?t=1745244503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153020/19e395b79a0d1ff8200a3a54f3ac86e259c9010e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745244503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store